#Linux
Mpụta dee: (Iwu ls -la), ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
Mpụta dee: (Ụzọ /home gabor Desktop), ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
Mpụta dee: (Ụzọ /root: ['my\\ documents'], business presentations), ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
Mpụta dee: ((Iwu ls: ['my\\ documents']) > ['list.txt']), ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
Mpụta dee: ((Iwu do: ['this'], na: ['that'])), ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
Mpụta dee: ((Ụzọ go: ['here'], na: ['there'])), ahịrị-ọhụrụ.